eyes MD\" is a controlled medical device (generic name: program for general-purpose diagnostic imaging workstations, certification number: 302ADBZX00011000) under the \"Act on Quality, Efficacy and Safety Assurance of Pharmaceuticals, Medical Devices, etc.\" (Pharmaceuticals and Medical Devices Act)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "md_logo.png", "id": "5998065973633964", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003260_5998065976967297_260827317627691552_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1dWmzOc9d1IQ7kNvwGee_Gz&_nc_oc=AdkS3USQ5fXNysvfh6SM5MMnIjU0KPRFZvFY4kBOaACsbxGrbWF_-zebHeyGmqYIA6k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aful9ZV8l9G42ZTL9C0Eo98gAqVEBy5lRnZ9LL_F6C7lbQ&oe=699852CD"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_tate.png", "id": "2303415159832893", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974904_2303415163166226_7688600240374808365_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2HIFVQIlGIkQ7kNvwGZbbW8&_nc_oc=Adlaj6dbl6rEJHcAHD868xTsrWZH55_0-sTq5IrhJISGavoVAZja3Z89DGaJpM1I0Cs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs_mGcyCu9SmC8Q8FMjAP9IMfwseruOIf3F4ERmVYot6g&oe=6998452C"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_miniyoko.png", "id": "950325029433473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031585_950325032766806_6345836855774372629_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zS0dJKzUa3IQ7kNvwGDpjwH&_nc_oc=AdlVH8c_MEeCpimWJ1OUUKd9BtVoCqkACwEXwQgG7ZU7RyFF8ESFGBybj8fCBSuCTk4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftn5UuNu0txJ0zp8IdSfK4CB6_JP0EnXLDcIA0OJUR7Tw&oe=699866BD"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_yoko.png", "id": "773168277532939", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75223486_773168280866272_6988374572968566012_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kgn8HgkOqsMQ7